ds the network (172.16.1.0/24 - the GRE tunnel interface address)\\n4. Enables point-to-multipoint mode for the network\", 'trans_template': 'network 172.16.1.0 0.0.0.255'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'p2mp enable', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Huawei equivalent command for the Juniper OSPF interface configuration:\\n\\n##\\nospf 1  \\n area 0.0.0.0  \\n  network 172.16.1.0 0.0.0.255  \\n  p2mp enable  \\n##\\n\\nNote: Huawei doesn't have an exact 1:1 mapping for GRE tunnel interface OSPF configuration like Juniper. The Huawei equivalent:\\n1. Creates an OSPF process (ospf 1)\\n2. Configures the area (0.0.0.0)\\n3. Adds the network (172.16.1.0/24 - the GRE tunnel interface address)\\n4. Enables point-to-multipoint mode for the network\", 'trans_template': 'p2mp enable'}]]": 1,
